WEBVTT

00:00:00.581 --> 00:00:01.310
Hi there!

00:00:01.335 --> 00:00:05.710
Tositeo is built so business owners and accountants work together in one place.

00:00:06.059 --> 00:00:09.987
This lesson covers inviting your accountant, storing your company documents,

00:00:09.937 --> 00:00:12.590
and moving your old data over from another service.

00:00:13.189 --> 00:00:15.399
In the Settings menu, choose Your accountant.

00:00:15.734 --> 00:00:19.159
Enter your accountant's e-mail, then click Send invitation.

00:00:19.588 --> 00:00:23.399
Accountant accounts are free, and each accountant logs in with their own account.

00:00:23.869 --> 00:00:27.719
The invitation stays under Invitations waiting until the accountant accepts.

00:00:28.228 --> 00:00:30.919
An accountant can also ask for access with your business ID.

00:00:31.268 --> 00:00:35.079
Then you decide whether to Accept or Decline, right on this page.

00:00:35.608 --> 00:00:38.602
Once you're connected, you see the accounting firm's name,

00:00:38.552 --> 00:00:40.378
and each accountant who has access.

00:00:40.684 --> 00:00:44.277
They can see receipts, travel claims and bank transactions,

00:00:44.227 --> 00:00:46.138
and make the export themselves.

00:00:46.487 --> 00:00:48.858
To stop, click End access.

00:00:49.259 --> 00:00:53.498
To switch to another accounting firm, enter the e-mail under Change accountant.

00:00:54.004 --> 00:00:56.214
Documents is your company's filing cabinet:

00:00:56.330 --> 00:01:01.654
contracts, insurance, meeting minutes, financial statements, payslips.

00:01:02.083 --> 00:01:07.014
Click Upload documents, choose a folder, give it a title, and choose who can see it:

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:10.134
Everyone in the company, or only Admins and accountant.

00:01:10.563 --> 00:01:12.694
Choose the file, then click Upload.

00:01:13.043 --> 00:01:17.254
For lots of papers, put them in one ZIP file and upload it in one go.

00:01:17.864 --> 00:01:21.910
Documents are sorted into folders, and you can find them with the search box.

00:01:22.289 --> 00:01:25.270
Your accountant can also send you reports or payslips here.

00:01:25.619 --> 00:01:29.670
Employees who only need to read documents use the Reader role, free of charge.

00:01:30.274 --> 00:01:32.724
Using another service, like eTasku?

00:01:33.018 --> 00:01:34.724
Open Move from another service.

00:01:34.913 --> 00:01:38.369
Upload the receipt summary as a CSV file, and if you have it,

00:01:38.319 --> 00:01:40.324
a ZIP file with the receipt images.

00:01:40.593 --> 00:01:42.164
Then click Check the files.

00:01:42.352 --> 00:01:44.644
You preview every column and every row.

00:01:44.993 --> 00:01:48.564
Nothing is saved until you confirm, and duplicate receipts are skipped.

00:01:48.806 --> 00:01:49.364
Note:

00:01:49.591 --> 00:01:52.776
log in to your old service yourself to download the files,

00:01:52.726 --> 00:01:54.884
and never give your password to anyone.

00:01:55.501 --> 00:01:58.973
From now on, all your company's records are neatly in one place,

00:01:58.923 --> 00:02:01.218
and your accountant always has everything.

00:02:01.457 --> 00:02:02.898
Now take the quiz below.
